66c2194b-972b-4360-8899-30f719b6aed2	sudhir.narale@dypiu.ac.in	2025-2026	anupama.patil@dypiu.ac.in	director	145.45555555555557702973601408302783966064453125	60	205.45555555555557702973601408302783966064453125	Mr. Sudhir Narale is a sincere and dedicated faculty member who is well-regarded by his students and consistently receives positive academic feedback. He actively contributes to the institution's ongoing work in the admission cell.  It is noted that he currently has very few contributions in the area of research. He is strongly advised to shift more of his focus toward improving his research profile and publishing his work in academic journals.  He is also advised to enhance the use of software tools such as MATLAB and other ICT-based pedagogical methods for teaching Mathematics. He has to be proactive and participative.Additionally, to further his professional and academic growth, it is highly suggested that he prioritize completing his Ph.D. at the earliest opportunity.	{"acr": [{"hod": "3", "label": "Self-motivation and Proactiveness", "director": "3"}, {"hod": "4", "label": "Punctuality", "director": "4"}, {"hod": "4", "label": "Target based work", "director": "3"}, {"hod": "4", "label": "Effectiveness", "director": "3"}, {"hod": "4", "label": "Obedience", "director": "4"}], "ict": [{"hod": "5", "desc": "Think Share activity conducted on 17/4/2026", "quad": "IV", "type": "class activity", "score": "5", "title": "Pedagogy", "director": "5", "quadrant": "IV", "description": "Think Share activity conducted on 17/4/2026"}, {"hod": "5", "desc": "Website development", "quad": "III", "type": "online", "score": "5", "title": "E Content developed", "director": "5", "quadrant": "III", "description": "Website development"}, {"hod": "5", "desc": "Engineering Mathematics", "quad": "IV", "type": "Online", "score": "5", "title": "Course Builder Coursera Course", "director": "5", "quadrant": "IV", "description": "Engineering Mathematics"}, {"hod": "5", "desc": "Basic mathe