74e13f7c-46c5-4770-bfd5-10cb4f80cfb2	dinesh.kumar@dypiu.ac.in	2025-2026	swapnil.bhurat@dypiu.ac.in	director	194.16666666666668561447295360267162322998046875	151	345.16666666666668561447295360267162322998046875	Mr. Dinesh is a very mature young faculty member of SoCE. He is an extremely smart person who understands the best possible use of technology. In many instances, while working in SoCE, he has created many templates that makes SoCE work far more easy. He helps faculty members when needed to execute a few important tasks. He has always assisted me in many school-level activities. His research skills are very high, he should use them to the full extent. Throughout the year, he has worked on many dual responsibilities, such as handling projects for AA and TML , and an internship for AA and TML.   His CAD skills are very good. Always using some new pedagogy in teaching, I appreciate his innovative and smart skills, which are very useful for SoCE.	{"acr": [{"label": "Self-motivation and Proactiveness", "director": "5"}, {"label": "Punctuality", "director": "5"}, {"label": "Target based work", "director": "5"}, {"label": "Effectiveness", "director": "5"}, {"label": "Obedience", "director": "5"}], "ict": [{"hod": "", "desc": "Channel is basically focused on  providing step-by-step tutorials that will guide you through the entire process, so you can learn at your own pace and become a skilled CAD designer and simulation engineer.", "quad": "Quadrant I", "type": "YouTube Channel (https://www.youtube.com/@cadomania_D)", "score": "5", "title": "YouTube Channel of CAD and Ansys Simulations", "director": "5", "quadrant": "Quadrant I", "description": "Channel is basically focused on  providing step-by-step tutorials that will guide you through the entire process, so you can learn at your own pace and become a skilled CAD designer and simulation engineer."}, {"desc": "Vibrations Lab Pro is an interactive, web-based NVH simulator that eliminates the need for software installations by operating entirely within the browser. The platform utilizes a custom Runge-Kutta (RK4) physics engine to dynamically solve and visualize complex kinematics for Single-Degree-of-Freedom (SDOF), vehicle suspension, and rotor balancing systems. By allowing users to actively manipulate variables such as mass, stiffness, and damping, the tool provides instant feedback on mechanical responses across various operational regimes. Furthermore, advanced visual analytics translate abstract mathematics into real-time mechanical animations, interactive phase plots, and transmissibility curves using dynamic browser rendering. Ultimately, the simulator bridges theoretical concepts and practical application, empowering students to conduct virtual experiments and export raw CSV data for empirical lab reporting.", "quad": "Quadrant III", "type": "Web App", "score": "5", "title": "Noise VIbration and Harshness Simulator", "director": "5", "quadrant": "Quadrant III", "description": "Vibrations Lab Pro is an interactive, web-based NVH simulator that eliminates the need for software installations by operating entirely within the browser. The platform utilizes a custom Runge-Kutta (RK4) physics engine to dynamically solve and visualize complex kinematics for Single-Degree-of-Freedom (SDOF), vehicle suspension, and rotor balancing systems. By allowing users to actively manipulate variables such as mass, stiffness, and damping, the tool provides instant feedback on mechanical responses across various operational regimes. Furthermore, advanced visual analytics translate abstract mathematics into real-time mechanical animations, interactive phase plots, and transmissibility curves using dynamic browser rendering. Ultimately, the simulator bridges theoretical concepts and practical application, empowering students to conduct virtual experiments and export raw CSV data for empirical lab reporting."}, {"desc": "A student-focused website offering easy access to course materials and a blo