s-on learning, improve conceptual clarity, and enhance skill development in Engineering Materials and Metallurgy.", "score": "10", "usage": "The developed products are actively used by students in laboratory sessions for practical understanding of manufacturing processes, crystal structures, and microstructure observation techniques. These educational models and specimens support hands-on learning, improve conceptual clarity, and enhance skill development in Engineering Materials and Metallurgy.", "details": "The product developed under the Product Development activity includes two different components. The first component consists of educational models and specimens developed using CNC Wood Router technology to demonstrate advanced manufacturing and machining practices. The second component includes separately prepared test specimens for microstructure observation and analysis in Engineering Materials and Metallurgy. These products enhance practical understanding, support experiential learning, and provide students with hands-on exposure to manufacturing and material characterization techniques.", "director": "5"}, {"hod": "10", "used": "Commercialized", "score": "10", "usage": "Commercialized", "details": "Commercial Product Development using CNC Wood Router Machine", "director": "10"}], "projects": [{"hod": "", "label": "", "score": "", "director": ""}], "research": [{"hod": "", "name": "", "score": "", "degree": "", "thesis": "", "director": "", "student_name": ""}], "training": [{"hod": "10", "score": "10", "nature": "Applied Mechatronics: PLC,HMI,SCADA & Process control systems", "company": "Tata Indian Institute of Skills", "director": "10", "duration": "one week"}, {"hod": "10", "score": "10", "nature": "CNC/VMC Mchining technology module machining center", "company": "Ace Micromatic", "director": "10", "duration": "one week"}], "innovRows": [{"hod": "2", "score": "2", "method": "Blended learning", "details": "Shared online youtube links, mooc coueses link &