 Algorithms", "director": "3", "quadrant": "Quadrant I, II & III", "description": "Developed a structured digital learning course comprising recorded lectures, course materials, quizzes, and assignments aligned with outcome-based education practices."}, {"desc": "Developed and maintained the Dr. Sarika Digital Learning Ecosystem, a comprehensive academic and digital knowledge-sharing platform designed to support ICT-enabled teaching-learning, research dissemination, student engagement, innovation activities, and academic documentation. The platform serves as a centralized repository of course materials, e-content,  project outcomes, internships, and ranking/accreditation-related evidence.    The website promotes self-paced learning, digital accessibility, outcome-based education, and continuous knowledge sharing by providing structured access to academic resources and project guidance materials. It also supports institutional visibility, student mentoring, research culture, innovation dissemination, and documentation of academic contributions aligned with NAAC, NBA, NIRF, and quality assurance requirements.", "quad": "Quadrant I, II, III & IV", "type": "Academic Website / Digital Learning Ecosystem / Knowledge Management Platform", "score": "5", "title": "Website: Dr. Sarika Digital Learning Ecosystem:  https://sites.google.com/dypiu.ac.in/drsarika-digitallearningecosys", "director": "3", "quadrant": "Quadrant I, II, III & IV", "description": "Developed and maintained the Dr. Sarika Digital Learning Ecosystem, a comprehensive academic and digital knowledge-sharing platform designed to support ICT-enabled teaching-learning, research dissemination, student engagement, innovation activities, and academic documentation. The platform serves as a centralized repository of course materials, e-content,  project outcomes, internships, and ranking/accreditation-related evidence.    The website promotes self-paced learning, digital accessibility, outcome-based education, and continuous knowledge sharing by providing structured access to academic resources and project guidance materials. It also supports institutional visibility, student mentoring, research culture, innovation dissemination, and documentation of academic contributions aligned with NAAC, NBA, NIRF, and quality assurance requirements."}, {"desc": "Developed and maintained an educational YouTube channel as part of a digital learning ecosystem to support ICT-enabled teaching-learning practices. The channel hosts recorded lectures, project demonstrations, technology tutorials, student project presentations, workshop recordings, research-related content, low-code/no-code application development demonstrations, UI/UX design concepts, software engineering topics, and academic guidance resources.", "quad": "Quadrant I – e-Tutorials & II", "type": "Educational YouTube Channel / E-Content Development Platform", "score": "5", "title": "Educational YouTube Channel for Digital Learning and Knowledge Dissemination:  https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCp5j5ennY1zV_iE22Mj9DaA", "director": "3", "quadrant": "Quadrant I – e-Tutorials & II", "description": "Developed and maintained an educational YouTube channel as part of a digital learning ecosystem to support ICT-enabled teaching-learning practices. The channel hosts recorded lectures, project demonstrations, technology tutorials, student project presentations, workshop recordings, research-related content, low-code/no-code application development demonstrations, UI/UX design concepts, software engineering topics, and academic guidance resources."}, {"desc": "Developed and shared academic presentations through the SlideShare platform to support ICT-enabled teaching-learning, self-paced learning, and knowledge dissemination. The uploaded presentations cover emerging and curriculum-relevant topics such as Web Frameworks, Linked Lists and Data Structures, Data Encryption Techniques and Standards, Secure Software Engineering, and Software Security. These resources provide students and learners with easy access to structured learning materials beyond classroom sessions and serve as supplementary reference content for concept reinforcement and independent learning.  The initiative promotes open educational resources, digital knowledge sharing, and continuous learning by making subject-specific content accessible to a wider academic community.", "quad": "Quadrant II – e-Content (Study Material and Learning Resources)", "type": "Digital Learning Resource / E-Content Development", "score": "5", "title": "SlideShare-Based Knowledge Dissemination and E-Content Development", "director": "3", "quadrant": "Quadrant II – e-Content (Study Material and Learning Resources)", "description": "Developed and shared academic presentations through the SlideShare platform to support ICT-enabled teaching-learning, self-paced learning, and knowledge dissemination. The uploaded presentations cover emerging and curriculum-relevant topics such as Web Frameworks, Linked Lists and Data Structures, Data Encryption Techniques and Standards, Secure Software Engineering, and Software Security. These resources provide students and learners with easy access to structured learning materials beyond classroom sessions and serve as supplementary reference content for concept reinforcement and independent learning.  The initiative promotes open educational resources, digital knowledge sharing, and continuous learning by making subject-specific content accessible to a wider academic community."}, {"desc": "Developed and shared academic documents, project resources, technical reports, and subject-specific learning materials through the Scribd platform to support digital learning and open access to educational content. The published resources cover topics such as Mobile Application Development, Relational Database Design, Database Management Systems, and Software Engineering concepts. These materials provide students with additional reference resources, practical examples, and supplementary learning content to strengthen conceptual understanding and facilitate self-directed learning.  The initiative promotes knowledge sharing, digital accessibility, and continuous learning by making academic content available to students, educators, and learners beyond the classroom environment.", "quad": "Quadrant II – e-Content (Study Material and Learning Resources)", "type": "Digital Learning Resource / Academic Document Repository", "score": "5", "title": "Scribd-Based Academic Resource Sharing and Knowledge Dissemination", "director": "3", "quadrant": "Quadrant II – e-Content (Study Material and Learning Resources)", "description": "Developed and shared academic documents, project resources, technical reports, and subject-specific learning materials through the Scribd platform to support digital learning and open access to educational content. The published resources cover topics such as Mobile Application Development, Relational Database Design, Database Management Systems, and Software Engineering concepts. These materials provide students with additional reference resources, practical examples, and supplementary learning content to strengthen conceptual understanding and facilitate self-directed learning.  The initiative promotes knowledge sharing, digital accessibility, and continuous learning by making academic content available to students, educators, and learners beyond the classroom environment."}], "fdps": [{"hod": "", "org": "Department of Computer Science & Engineering, Sardar Vallabhbhai National Institute of Technology (SVNIT), Surat", "score": "5", "program": "Online FDP on Generative & Agentic AI – Tools and Demos", "director": "3", "duration": "6 Days (16–21 February 2026)", "organization": "Department of Computer Science & Engineering, Sardar Vallabhbhai National Institute of Technology (SVNIT), Surat"}, {"org": "Department of Computer Engineering, Pimpri Chinchwad College of Engineering (PCCOE), Pune