ion Multipurpose Hall, 6th Floor, J Block.", "activity": "Organised Blood Donation camp with YCM", "director": "5"}, {"dean": "5", "label": "Donation Drive for Emmanuel Orphanage on 2nd October 2025 ( Mahatma Gandhi Jayanti)", "score": "5", "details": "The Donation Drive was organised with the following objectives: •\\tTo commemorate Mahatma Gandhi Jayanti through a meaningful act of social service •\\tTo extend support and care to children residing at Emmanuel Orphanage •\\tTo instill values of compassion, empathy, and social responsibility among students •\\tTo encourage NSS volunteers to actively participate in community welfare initiatives •\\tTo promote the spirit of sharing and inclusive growth", "activity": "Donation Drive for Emmanuel Orphanage on 2nd October 2025 ( Mahatma Gandhi Jayanti)", "director": "5"}], "uniActs": [{"hod": "", "dean": "10", "score": "10", "nature": "The Deakin University Masterclass and Campus Immersion Program at Deakin University GIFT City Campus, Gandhinagar, Gujarat, was successfully conducted on 30 January 2026 with active participation from B.Tech, and MBA students of DYPIU. The visit provided valuable international academic exposure through expert-led masterclasses in Business Analytics, Cyber Security, and emerging technology domains. Students also participated in the campus tour, career services interaction, student services overview, and admissions briefing conducted by the Deakin University team.", "activity": "Deakin University Masterclass for 70 BTech & MBA", "director": "10"}, {"dean": "0", "score": "20", "nature": "Cordinated BBA ( 120 ) & MBA (60) Admissions for SCM - Allocated Student Interviews among faculties, Councelling, University meeting, etc", "activity": "SCM Admission Cordinator 2025", "director": "20"}, {"dean": "20", "score": "20", "nature": "Worked as NSS Programme Officer and coordinated various social welfare, community engagement, awareness, and student development activities at the university level. Ma