he subject. This activity enhances their understanding of research methodology, scientific writing, data analysis, literature review, and publication ethics. It also helps students develop critical thinking, communication, and presentation skills while providing them with exposure to real-world research and academic publication practices."}, {"dean": "5", "desc": "As a part of E-content development and digital learning initiatives, an educational website, Therapeutics Design & Discovery Lab, has been developed to provide publicly accessible online learning resources for students. The website includes subject descriptions, study materials, academic updates, and software resources developed and taught as part of the curriculum. Educational and research-oriented software tools such as ADSBET, GENBLOSUMxx, SBION2, APBEST, COSURIM, PHYSICO2, and PROPAB are available on the platform to enhance students’ practical understanding of bioinformatics and computational biology concepts. This platform supports self-directed learning, promotes ICT-enabled education, and enables students to access subject-related resources anytime and anywhere.", "quad": "Website", "type": "E-Content Development / ICT Enabled Teaching", "score": "5", "title": "E-Content", "director": "5", "quadrant": "Website", "description": "As a part of E-content development and digital learning initiatives, an educational website, Therapeutics Design & Discovery Lab, has been developed to provide publicly accessible online learning resources for students. The website includes subject descriptions, study materials, academic updates, and software resources developed and taught as part of the curriculum. Educational and research-oriented software tools such as ADSBET, GENBLOSUMxx, SBION2, APBEST, COSURIM, PHYSICO2, and PROPAB are available on the platform to enhance students’ practical understanding of bioinformatics and computational biology concepts. This platform supports self-directed learning, promotes ICT-enabled education, and enables students to access subject-related resources anytime and anywhere."}, {"dean": "5", "desc": "As a part of ICT-enabled teaching and E-content development, educational blogs related to the subject have been created and regularly updated on the Therapeutics Design platform. These blogs provide research-related information, conceptual explanations, and recent academic developments, helping students improve their subject knowledge, analytical thinking, and independent learning skills.", "quad": "Blog", "type": "Educational Blogs / Digital Content Development", "score": "5", "title": "E-Content", "director": "5", "quadrant": "Blog", "description": "As a part of ICT-enabled teaching and E-content development, educational blogs related to the subject have been created and regularly updated on the Therapeutics Design platform. These blogs provide research-related information, conceptual explanations, and recent academic developments, helping students improve their subject knowledge, analytical thinking, and independent learning skills."}, {"dean": "5", "desc": "As a part of ICT-mediated teaching-learning pedagogy, the \\"Comparing Genes, Proteins, and Genomics\\" online course was authorized and integrated through the Coursera Course Builder platform in collaboration with D Y Patil International University, enhancing the digital curriculum with globally benchmarked e-content to foster advanced analytical skills and independent, self-paced learning.", "quad": "Course created through course builder in Coursera.", "type": "Coursera Course Integration", "score": "5", "title": "Development of new and innovative course", "director": "5", "quadrant": "Course created through course builder in Coursera.", "description": "As a part of ICT-mediated teaching-learning pedagogy, the \\"Comparing Genes, Proteins, and Genomics\\" online course was authorized and integrated through the Coursera Course Builder platform in collaboration with D Y Patil International