e consensus-building."}, {"score": "2", "method": "Flipped Classroom Paradigm", "details": "Transitioned Google Classroom into an active hub by distributing core learning materials ahead of schedule, reserving active lecture hours strictly for case analysis and debates. Maximized classroom efficiency; shifted contact hours from passive content delivery to high-engagement, collaborative evaluation."}, {"score": "2", "method": "video and Experiential Learning Execution", "details": "Organized hands-on laboratory sessions for He-Ne Laser diffraction experiments, bridging theoretical wave optics with direct physical measurement. Demonstrated practical mastery; students independently calibrated optical apparatus, fulfilling critical laboratory course outcomes."}], "projects2": [{"hod": "", "role": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "sanction_date": "", "project_status": ""}], "proposals": [{"hod": "", "score": "10", "title": "Fabrication of 2D Layered Sensors via Spray Pyrolysis and Integration into IoT Platforms for Remote Sensing and Automated Decision-Making", "agency": "Anusandhan National Research Foundation (ANRF) Govt of India", "amount": "5910000", "director": "", "duration": "3 Years"}, {"score": "10", "title": "Fabrication of 2D Layered Sensors via Spray Pyrolysis and Integration into loT Platforms for Remote Sensing and Automated Decision-Making", "agency": "DYPIU Seed Money", "amount": "1725000", "duration": "3years"}], "courseFile": [{"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "Mechanical Engineering Semester I", "course": "Engineering Physics EME 1004 T Division Aand B  Engineering Physics", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "Semiconductor Engineering Semester I", "course": "Semiconductor device characterization Lab", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "Chemical Engineering Semester II", "course": "Physics for Engineers", "details": "1.Available", "direct