gineering Sem IV", "course": "GEN2101 Genetics", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "BTech Bioengineering Sem VI", "course": "MAT3105 Biomaterials", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}], "innovScore": "10", "innovDetails": "Quiz, Use of learning management system, Group Discussion and Debate, Public availability of resources, Research Article analysis", "externalProjects": [{"hod": "", "role": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "sanction_date": "", "project_status": ""}], "internalProjects": [], "summaryOtherInfo": "As the Head of the Department of Bioengineering, I have taken care of the admission, results, examinations, day-to-day activities of the School. Under the directions of the School Director, I have spearheaded the teaching load calculation of the faculty of the School and have aided in drafting of the Academic Regulations. With help from School faculty, I have also led the restructuring of the curriculum and course structure of B.Tech. Bioengineering. \\nI have also ensured smooth communication as the ACU ambassador on every day scale and hosted the ACU officials at DYPIU and organised their talks. \\nI am a journal editor at two Journals - Scientific Reports and Mechanobiological forces in cancer: A biophysical perspective in Frontiers in Biophysics. I am also a Board Member of Scientific Review. \\nI have guided several undergraduate student projects and are in process of filing additional 1 patent, 2 design registrations and 1 copyright. \\nI have submitted two more research articles which are still with the editors. ", "sectionSaveStatus": {"partA": true, "partB": true}, "sectionApplicability": {"society": "applicable", "projects": "applicable", "research": "applicable"}}, "status": "Pending Director Review", "totals": {"grandTotal": 407, "partATotal": 174, "partBTotal": 233, "effectiveGrandMax": 550, "effectivePartAMax": 175, "effectivePartBMax": 375}, "review_chain": ["director", "dean", "vc"], "academic_year": "2025-2026", "next_reviewer": "director", "workflow_status": "Pending Director Review", "submitter_profile": {"email": "surabhi.sonam@dypiu.ac.in", "school": "SoBB", "full_name": "Dr. Surabhi Sonam", "department": "", "experience": "", "designation": "Associate Professor , hod", "employee_id": "", "qualification": "", "appraisal_role": "faculty", "reportsToRegistrar": false, "teaching_experience": "", "reports_to_registrar": false}, "next_reviewer_role": "director"}	2026-05-25 09:59:14.822044+00	2026-05-29 18:27:21.385186+00
