ty": [{"hod": "", "score": "", "details": "", "activity": "", "director": ""}], "uniActs": [{"hod": "", "score": "30", "nature": "Served as DYPIU CET 2025 Exam Coordinator and Single Point of Contact (SPOC) for coordination with Codetantra using administrative access for examination management activities. Coordinated scheduling and execution of mock tests and entrance examinations for B.Tech. (CSE), BCA, MCA, and B.Tech. (Bioengineering) programmes. Managed question bank coordination, Teaching Assistant coordination, examination workflow monitoring, candidate management, real-time issue handling during examinations, examination rule implementation, passing criteria and shortlisting coordination, and operational decision-making during examination activities. Coordinated with university administration including VC, Directors, Trustee members, and Admission Department for result processing, shortlisting activities, and declaration of examination results.", "activity": "DYPIU CET 2025 Exam Coordinator", "director": ""}, {"score": "20", "nature": "Coordinated admission-related activities for the newly launched M.Sc. (Computational Mathematics) programme in coordination with the University Admission Team. Interacted with prospective candidates and parents regarding programme structure, academic opportunities, and admission procedures, scheduled and conducted admission interviews, coordinated candidate follow-ups, and supported admission processing activities. Also participated in university-level admission outreach activities during admission campaign visits at Patna for student interaction and programme awareness.", "activity": "Admission Activities and Programme Coordination"}, {"score": "30", "nature": "Nominated as a member of the University Doctoral Committee for framing guidelines, reviewing academic and research-related matters, and supporting the conduct of Ph.D. and Postdoctoral programmes in interdisciplinary research domains. Contributed to discussions related 