ration and syllabus coordination activities for B.Tech. (CSE), BCA, MCA, and M.Sc. (Computational Mathematics) programmes for current and upcoming academic years. Designed standardized LaTeX syllabus templates, guided and trained faculty members for LaTeX-based syllabus preparation, coordinated follow-ups for syllabus submission and corrections, verified and consolidated academic documents, and compiled programme-wise booklet documentation for academic circulation and record maintenance.", "activity": "Programme Booklet and Syllabus Coordination"}, {"score": "5", "nature": "Coordinated and monitored academic and administrative activities for First Year Div C and Div D during Semester II including student and parent communication, follow-ups regarding pending fees, JUNO updates, feedback forms, Coursera Ethics course completion, academic reminders, mentoring support, faculty coordination, syllabus update follow-ups, course file documentation activities, and smooth execution of academic processes.", "activity": "FY Academic In-charge – Div C and Div D (Sem-II)"}, {"score": "3", "nature": "Coordinated seating arrangement activities during the Student Induction Program, leading the team responsible for planning, organizing, and managing seating arrangements for newly admitted students and parents. Ensured smooth venue management, participant guidance, crowd coordination, and orderly conduct of the induction programme.", "activity": "Induction Program"}], "feedback": [{"hod": "", "score": "7.5", "director": "", "feedback_1": "75.58", "feedback_2": "74.415", "course_code": "CSE1001 (Applied Computational Mathematics)"}, {"score": "6.5", "feedback_1": "61.535", "feedback_2": "68.925", "course_code": "CSE1101 (Discrete Mathematics for Computer Science)"}], "industry": [{"hod": "", "name": "", "score": "", "details": "", "director": ""}], "journals": [{"hod": "", "issn": "1570-0755", "score": "5", "title": "Efficient Quantum Optimization using QEMC and Hybrid Encodings for M