 of an Innovative ICT-Mediated Integrated Pedagogy for First Year Chemical Engineering Students", "quadrant": "High Innovation, High Technology Integration", "description": "An innovative ICT-mediated teaching-learning pedagogy was developed for First Year Chemical Engineering students by integrating MATLAB, Python, C, C++, Excel, Virtual Labs, Coursera modules, and POLYMATH software into a single learning framework. This approach enhanced practical learning, computational skills, and student engagement through technology-enabled education"}, {"type": "Development of Innovative pedagogy which does not exists globally", "score": "5", "title": "Design and Development of an Innovative Faculty-Driven Digital Learning Ecosystem for Chemical Engineering Students", "quadrant": "High Innovation and High Technology Integration", "description": "A Next-Generation ICT-Enabled Digital Learning Ecosystem was developed for Chemical Engineering students through a dedicated Google Site integrating self-created videos, subject resources, career guidance, and digital learning tools. The platform provides a centralized, interactive, and 24×7 accessible learning environment that supports blended learning, self-paced education, and enhanced student engagement."}], "ipr": [], "fdps": [{"hod": "", "score": "10", "program": "Aicte Training And Learning (Atal) Academy Faculty Development Program on Smart And Sustainable Waste Management Using Iot And Data Analytics At Madanapalle Institute of Technology & Science", "director": "", "duration": "15/09/2025 to 20/09/2025", "organization": "AICTE-Madanapalle Institute of Technology & Science"}, {"score": "10", "program": "Emerging Frontiers in Energy, Climate and Sustainability", "duration": "08/09/2025 to 13/09/2025", "organization": "Nelson Mandela Marg, Vasant Kunj, New Delhi"}, {"score": "10", "program": "One Week MOOCs FDP – Innovative Ways of CO-PO Attainment: Newer Trends", "duration": "16/06/2025 to 20/06/2025", "organization": "IQAC, D