olicies and New policies\\n   a.\\tSeed Money Policy\\n   b.\\tResearch Grant Policy\\n   c.\\tUndergraduate Society policy\\n   d.\\tPhD (Doctoral Policy)\\n   e.\\tFeedback system and Policy\\n   f.\\tBenchmarks and Targets for Schools and Faculty\\n2.\\tOrientation for all faculty\\n   a.\\tOBE methodology implementation \\n   b.\\tNAAC awareness sessions\\n3.\\tAudits\\n   a.\\tInternal Academic and Administrative Audit\\n   b.\\tGender Audit\\n   c.\\tExternal Audit for NAAC documentation\\n4.\\tCurriculum framing of Mechanical Engineering\\n5.\\tVisits for Centre of Excellence Setup\\n   a.\\tKLE University Hubali\\n   b.\\tDassault Systems, Hinjewadi, Pune\\n   c.\\tAtlas Copco, Hinjewadi, Pune\\n   d.\\tSiemens CoE, NIMS, Jaipur\\n5.\\tDesigning of recent Appraisal System of DYPIU \\n6.     Data Submission to Various Rankings\\n    a.  NIRF\\n    b.  IIRF\\n    c.  India Today Ranking \\n    d.  National Green University Ranking 2026\\n    e. R- World Survey\\n7. Student SAE-India e-BAJA Mentor\\n   A Team of 40 Students is working under my mentorship for BAJA activity from last 1 year. In SAE-India e-BAJA 2026 competition Team Genesis 16 of DYPIU shown impressive performance and stood 4th in overall rankings. Being first time participant, this is a remarkable achievement of the team.\\n", "sectionSaveStatus": {"partA": true, "partB": true}, "sectionApplicability": {"society": "applicable", "projects": "notApplicable", "research": "notApplicable"}}, "status": "Pending HOD Review", "totals": {"grandTotal": 381.35, "partATotal": 163.35, "partBTotal": 218, "effectiveGrandMax": 510, "effectivePartAMax": 165, "effectivePartBMax": 345}, "review_chain": ["hod", "director", "dean", "vc"], "academic_year": "2025-2026", "next_reviewer": "hod", "workflow_status": "Pending HOD Review", "submitter_profile": {"email": "sunil.dambhare@dypiu.ac.in", "school": "SoEMR", "full_name": "Dr Sunil Dambhare", "department": "Mechanical Engineering", "experience": "29", "designation"