ant M., Shilpa, Madhuri P., Sunita Salunke)"}], "deptActs": [{"hod": "", "score": "10", "nature": "Academic Year  Activity (both Sem)", "activity": "Time  Table  coordinator", "director": ""}, {"score": "5", "nature": "Semester Based (Sem V) in July25-Dec25", "activity": "Academic  coordinator"}, {"score": "5", "nature": "Semester Based (Sem II A&B) in Jan 26-Dec26", "activity": "Academic In-charge"}, {"score": "3", "nature": "Short Term Activity (oordinated the student visit to the university on 30 January and the exclusive Virtual Masterclass organized by Deakin University India Campus, GIF on 16 April through continuous email communication. The coordination included communicating with students, preparing Google Forms to collect their interest for the visit, and resolving their queries regarding expenses, stay, and other arrangements.)", "activity": "Deakin University Masterclass & Campus Immersion Program Coordination-Coordinated student participation for two events—a visit conducted on 30 January and a Virtual Masterclass organized by Deakin University on 16 April—through continuous email communication. The coordination involved communicating with students, designing and circulating Google Forms to collect their interest for the visit, addressing queries related to expenses, accommodation, and other arrangements, and ensuring their participation in the sessions."}, {"score": "10", "nature": "Academic Year Activity (both Sem)", "activity": "Co-curricular & extracurricular co-ordinator"}, {"score": "3", "nature": "Short Term Activity on 7/10/ 2025", "activity": "Co-ordinator IBM Curriculum & Enablement Workshop for Faculty"}, {"score": "3", "nature": "Short Term Activity on 6/11/ 2025", "activity": "Co-ordinator IBM ICE Program for  Students’ : Career Guidance Sessions"}], "feedback": [{"hod": "", "score": "7.3", "director": "", "feedback_1": "69.65", "feedback_2": "76.48", "course_code": "Advanced Probability and Statistics (A)"}, {"score": "8.2", "feedback_1": "