\\tVerified and approved grade sheets as part of academic assessment processes.\\n10.\\tConducted follow-up and coordination for FY Coursera student feedback completion for Divisions I & J.\\n11.\\tEnsured mandatory student feedback submission through regular reminders and follow-up communication.\\n12.\\tCoordinated collection and verification of ABC IDs for FY students prior to mid-term examinations.\\n13.\\tFollowed up with students regarding incomplete/incorrect ABC ID submissions and profile forms.\\n14.\\tPrepared and conducted Coursera quiz/examination activities for the course Ethics, Culture & Global Perspectives.\\n15.\\tCoordinated Coursera certificate collection and uploaded student assessment results in Juno ERP.\\n16.\\tEnsured feedback submission compliance in Juno for assigned divisions.\\n17.\\tConducted a Coursera examination for FY students as scheduled and managed related academic coordination.\\n18.\\tServed as auditor for the Internal Academic & Administrative Audit (AAA) for AY 2025–26 Semester I and Semester II.\\n19.\\tFormally recognized as PhD research supervisor at DYPIU under Dy. Dean R&D office.\\n20.\\tContributed to NAAC criteria documentation review and internal/external audit preparation activities.\\n21.\\tProvided institutional data and supporting documentation for R World/Asia Ranking/NIRF submissions.\\n22.\\tParticipated in IQAC committee meetings and accreditation-related review processes.\\n23.\\tCoordinated and monitored NAAC status documentation and tracking activities.\\n24.\\tWorked on accreditation follow-up activities as part of the institutional team.\\n25.\\tIncluded in the 10-Criteria restructuring and documentation office order for NAAC activities.\\n26.\\tReviewed and coordinated documentation related to award/ranking submissions.\\n27.\\tParticipated in IQAC audit preparation activities, including Attribute-2 (HR audit) coordination.\\n", "sectionSaveStatus": {"partA": true, "partB": true}, "sectionApplicability":