data and documentation. Regularly track documentation gaps, coordinate with faculty members for compliance, and contribute towards improving the department’s academic documentation and audit preparedness.", "activity": "Academic Audit Co-ordinator", "director": ""}, {"score": "", "nature": "", "activity": ""}], "feedback": [{"hod": "", "score": "8.0", "director": "", "feedback_1": "82", "feedback_2": "78", "course_code": "Control system for EV  BEE2203"}, {"score": "8.2", "feedback_1": "82", "feedback_2": "82", "course_code": "Control System for EV BEE2213"}, {"score": "8.9", "feedback_1": "89", "feedback_2": "89", "course_code": "Cybersecurity Basics BEE4205"}], "industry": [{"hod": "", "name": "", "score": "", "details": "", "director": ""}], "journals": [{"hod": "", "issn": "", "score": "", "title": "", "journal": "", "director": "", "indexing": ""}], "lectures": [{"hod": "", "score": "50", "director": "", "semester": "Sem IV", "course_code": "BEE2203(Control system for EV)", "planned_classes": "24", "conducted_classes": "28"}, {"hod": "", "score": "50", "director": "", "semester": "Sem VIII", "course_code": "BEE4205", "planned_classes": "24", "conducted_classes": "27"}, {"hod": "", "score": "50", "director": "", "semester": "Sem IV", "course_code": "BEE2213(Control system for Ev lab)", "planned_classes": "12", "conducted_classes": "12"}], "products": [{"hod": "", "score": "", "usage": "", "details": "", "director": ""}], "projects": [{"hod": "", "label": "Elimination of Customer Complaint of Cylinder Head Cover (CHC) Noise Issue", "score": "1", "director": ""}, {"label": "Design and development of sequential torquing confirmation arrangement for engine top cover assembly", "score": "2"}, {"label": "Auto SAP booking and invoice preparation using barcode scanning data from PDI", "score": "1"}, {"label": "Unified pallets for front axles", "score": "1"}, {"label": "Elimination of process related issues in harrier EV", "score": "2"}, {"label": "ANALYSIS AND REDUCTION DAY RUNING LIGHT (DRL) DAMAGE ISSUE IN SAFARI HARRIER VEHICLE", "score": "1"}, {"label": "Integrated Thinner Reduction and Solvent Recovery for Sustainable Manufacturing in Automotive Paint", "score": "2"}], "research": [{"hod": "", "score": "", "degree": "", "thesis": "", "director": "", "student_name": ""}], "training": [{"hod": "", "score": "", "nature": "", "company": "", "director": "", "duration": ""}], "innovRows": [{"score": "2", "method": "Quizes", "details": "Designed and conducted multiple interactive quizzes in the Cyber Security subject to enhance student engagement and participation during lectures. Most of the quizzes were case study and scenario-based, enabling students to develop practical problem-solving skills and apply theoretical concepts to real-world cybersecurity situations."}, {"score": "2", "method": "Coursera course", "details": "Integrated Coursera-based assignments into the teaching-learning process to encourage self-paced learning and industry-oriented skill development among students. Students were assigned relevant online courses and assessments to enhance their conceptual understanding and exposure to emerging technologies."}, {"score": "2", "method": "LMS module for academic activities", "details": "The Learning Management System (LMS) module was effectively utilized as a communication and academic support platform for students throughout the academic session. The LMS served as a centralized medium for conducting and managing various teaching-learning activities in an organized and efficient manner."}, {"score": "2", "method": "Blended mode of teaching", "details": "Considering the academic requirements and professional commitments of working professionals, lectures and revision sessions were conducted in both online and offline modes to ensure flexibility and effective learning support."}, {"score": "2", "method": "self paced learning", "details": "To promote flexible and continuous learning, I create and share recorded video lectures on Cyber Security topics. These videos provide concise coverage of key concepts and are made available to students for self-paced learning. The recordings enable students to revisit topics anytime for revision, better understanding, and independent learning."}], "projects2": [{"hod": "", "role": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "sanction_date": "", "project_status": ""}], "proposals": [{"hod": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "director": "", "duration": ""}], "courseFile": [{"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "B.Tech EE Sem IV", "course": "Control System", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "B.Tech EE Sem VIII", "course": "Cyber security", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}], "innovScore": "10", "innovDetails": "Quizes, Coursera course, LMS module for academic activities, Blended mode of teaching, self paced learning", "externalProjects": [{"hod": "", "role": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "sanction_date": "", "project_status": ""}], "internalProjects": [], "summaryOtherInfo": "", "sectionSaveStatus": {"partA": true, "partB": true}, "sectionApplicability": {"society": "notApplicable", "projects": "applicable", "research": "notApplicable"}}, "status": "Pending Director Review", "totals": {"grandTotal": 163.36666666666667, "partATotal": 153.36666666666667, "partBTotal": 10, "effectiveGrandMax": 510, "effectivePartAMax": 165, "effectivePartBMax": 345}, "review_chain": ["director", "dean", "vc"], "academic_year": "2025-2026", "next_reviewer": "director", "workflow_status": "Pending Director Review", "submitter_profile": {"email": "shruti.joglekar@dypiu.ac.in", "school": "SoCE", "full_name": "Mrs. Shruti Ravindra Joglekar", "department": "", "experience": "", "designation": "Assistant Professor", "employee_id": "", "qualification": "", "appraisal_role": "faculty", "reportsToRegistrar": false, "teaching_experience": "", "reports_to_registrar