138cefe0-9019-42e4-8912-fe1048450a68	sandesh.solepatil@dypiu.ac.in	2025-2026	standard	B3. ICT / E-Content / Pedagogy	\N	1	Pedagogical Innovation Using 3D Printed Models for Teaching Kinematics of Mechanisms and Machine Elements	An innovative teaching-learning pedagogy was developed using customized 3D printed working models for subjects related to Kinematics of Mechanisms and Machine Elements. The pedagogy integrates physical visualization, motion analysis, and experiential learning to improve conceptual understanding of complex mechanical systems. Different mechanism models such as four-bar linkages, slider-crank mechanisms, Geneva mechanisms, cams and followers, and compliant mechanisms were designed and fabricated using additive manufacturing techniques.	3D Printed Interactive Teaching Models, Experiential Learning Module, OBE-Based Activity, Project-Based Learning	III	5	30	20	20	\N	2026-05-22 11:14:57.917137+00	2026-06-02 07:47:17.880886+00
