1e473ae9-1b0a-4f45-bd77-add52f0f90d7	maan.kanth@dypiu.ac.in	2025-2026	media	Contribution to Society	\N	1	Unnat Bharat Abhiyan	\N	As part of DYPIU’s social outreach initiatives commemorating the birthday of Hon’ble Dr. D. Y. Patil Sir, I actively contributed to community engagement activities in the adopted village of Sathesai, Taluka Mulshi, Pune District. Representing the School of Mass Media & Journalism, I coordinated the donation of dustbins to promote cleanliness, environmental awareness, and sustainable community practices. The initiative involved village-level outreach, stakeholder coordination, and sensitizing students towards social responsibility, sanitation awareness, and community development. Through this contribution, I supported DYPIU’s vision of rural engagement and education-driven social transformation.	5	\N	8	\N	\N	2026-05-29 11:56:55.412132+00	2026-06-03 07:09:51.634794+00
